<% content_for :meta_title, "Sponsors | #{default_page_title}" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, 'NWRUG is kindly supported by our sponsors.' %>

<article class="no-aside" id="sponsors-page">
  <h1>Sponsors</h1>

  <p>NWRUG is kindly supported by our sponsors:</p>

  <section>
    <h2>
      <%= link_to 'https://www.brightbox.com/?utm_source=nwrug' do %>
        <span class="visually-hidden">Brightbox</span>
        <%= image_tag '/images/sponsors/brightbox.svg', alt: '', class: 'sponsor-logo' %>
      <% end %>
    </h2>
    <p>Brightbox is a UK-based cloud hosting provider. Brightbox provide the hosting for this website.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>
      <%= link_to 'https://www.fatsoma.com/?utm_source=nwrug' do %>
        <span class="visually-hidden">Fatsoma</span>
        <%= image_tag '/images/sponsors/fatsoma.svg', alt: '', class: 'sponsor-logo' %>
      <% end %>
    </h2>
    <p>Fatsoma is a ticketing and event marketing platform. Fatsoma sponsor the venue for our events.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>
      <%= link_to 'https://thoughtbot.com/?utm_source=nwrug' do %>
        <span class="visually-hidden">thoughtbot</span>
        <%= image_tag '/images/sponsors/thoughtbot.svg', alt: '', class: 'sponsor-logo' %>
      <% end %>
    </h2>
    <p>thoughtbot is a software design and development consultancy. thoughtbot provide the refreshments at our events.</p>
  </section>

    <section>
    <h2 id="sponsor-nwrug">Sponsor NWRUG</h2>
    <p>
      NWRUG is a community-run group and we are always grateful for sponsorship from companies looking to support the
      work that we do. If you would like to sponsor NWRUG, <%= link_to 'get in touch', 'mailto:info@nwrug.org' %>. We
      generally use sponsorship money to cover the various costs of running and hosting our events. In return for your
      sponsorship, NWRUG will:
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>mention the sponsorship on the details page for the corresponding event</li>
      <li>mention the sponsorship on the announcement email sent to <%= link_to 'the mailing list', mailing_list_url %></li>
      <li>post about the sponsorship on social media</li>
      <li>mention the sponsorship at the event itself and give you the opportunity to make a short announcement at the start of the event so you can talk to the group</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</article>
